--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
BornoTSF compatibility components (GPL-3.0-or-later)

The directory src/layouts/borno_compat/ (the Borno Phonetic, Avro Phonetic
and Khipro .mim engines) together with assets/dictionaries/ac.json, the
canonical assets/layouts/bn-khipro.mim and the layout icons under
assets/layout-icons/borno/ implement the behaviour of the BornoTSF project
(https://github.com/JayedAhsan/BornoTSF), Copyright (c) Jayed Ahsan Saad and
BornoTSF contributors, licensed under the GNU General Public License version
3 or later (GPL-3.0-or-later). The engines were re-authored for Suborno
(V18) while preserving the upstream behaviour; output parity with the
original BornoTSF engines is pinned by the regression suite in
tests/unit/borno_compat_parity_test.cpp (836 inputs x 3 engines,
byte-identical). The behavioural provenance is
cppAvroPhonetic, Copyright (c) 2014-2015 Muhammad Mominul Huque, likewise
GPL-3.0-or-later, and the Khipro layout data is Copyright (c) 2024
rank_coder, licensed under the MIT license.

Because these components are licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later, DISTRIBUTING
this project (in source or binary form, including the Windows installer)
conveys the whole combination under GPL-3.0-or-later with respect to those
components and, per GPL-3 section 5, the combined work must be distributed
under GPL-3 terms. The SPDX headers inside src/layouts/borno_compat/ mark the
exact file set. Everything outside that directory remains MIT as above.
